    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the suburbs.</strong> <br>Everything looks perfect \u2014 until you take a closer look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>CRIME LAWN REPEAT</strong>, you play as a man who moves to a quiet suburban neighborhood with his younger brother for reasons no one knows. New house, new neighbors, a fresh start... or so it seems. Behind the manicured lawns, friendly smiles, and backyard barbecues lie dirty secrets \u2014 and you might be one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Explore a world of suburban irony</strong> <br>Meet the locals, get involved in their routines \u2014 and uncover what they\u2019re really hiding. In this neighborhood, even the gnomes know more than they let on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3c <strong>Live a double life</strong> <br>By day, you\u2019re a caring brother and a polite neighbor. By night \u2014 someone who hides the evidence and digs for the truth. Your choices shape your reputation, and reputation defines your alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f <strong>Pretending is your best outfit</strong> <br>Learn to lie, or play by the rules. Only you decide who your character becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Nothing is ever simple</strong> <br>Casual gameplay mixed with a story full of twists, black humor, and suburban suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel with branching paths and suburban satire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style \u2014 from pastel facades to shadowy basements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret relationships, investigations, suspicious neighbors\u2026 and a bit of brotherly responsibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your choices and the person you choose to become</p></li></ul>",
